* stress-test.cos -- generated, large multi-script document for the
* Phase 6 fullAnalysis latency benchmark harness (apps/demo/bench/) and
* manual load/edit-latency spot checks (plan/07-demo-app-and-verification.md
* edge cases). Concatenated short per-agent event scripts, matching how a
* real .cos file actually grows large in practice -- not one deeply nested
* script.

